flowchart LR
  U[Operators / Browser] --> EC2
  SRC[Camera / OBS / Encoder] -->|RTMPS| IVS
  subgraph EC2[Amazon EC2 - Microservices Platform]
    WEB[Web UI]
    API[API + Auth / RBAC]
    EVT[Events + IVS Provisioning]
    LIVE[Live Operations]
    AI[AI Orchestrator + Frame / Audio Adapters]
    LIB[Media Library]
    CLIP[Clip / Export Worker]
    LLM[Ask MediaFlux AI / Bedrock Adapter]
    USERS[User Management]
    WEB --> API
    API --> EVT
    API --> LIVE
    API --> LIB
    API --> AI
    API --> CLIP
    API --> LLM
    API --> USERS
  end
  EVT -->|CreateChannel with optional recording| IVS[Amazon IVS]
  IVS -->|Playback| LIVE
  IVS -->|Optional recording| S3[(Amazon S3)]
  S3 -->|Recording playback + assets| LIB
  AI -->|Sampled images| REK[Amazon Rekognition]
  AI -->|Audio adapter| TR[Amazon Transcribe]
  TR -->|Transcript text| TL[Amazon Translate]
  REK -->|Faces + observations| AI
  TL -->|Arabic / English| AI
  AI -->|Metadata| LIB
  CLIP -->|Media input + timecodes| MC[AWS Elemental MediaConvert]
  S3 -->|Recorded media| MC
  MC -->|Transcoded clip| S3
  LLM -->|Retrieve permitted transcript + metadata| LIB
  LLM -->|Summarize / answer| BEDROCK[Amazon Bedrock]
  BEDROCK -->|Generated response| LLM
  SRC -.->|Optional independent audio/frame capture for near-live AI| AI
